    "body": "It looks like `ubuntu-latest` on Github Actions is switching from 24.04 to 26.04. GCC 10 isn't available there so anything running ci-run.sh is failing on those runners. GCC 11 is on that and on 24.04 so seems like the smallest increment for the default version.\n\nOther options that would work on both are 12, 13, or 14.",
